    "label": "manage-role, manage-access and manage-license on roles this run creates",
    "why": "A functional role under All employees and a division beside it, with ids the harness generates. Creatio adds a managers group under the division, which is found with ensure-manager and deleted before the division. The role gets an IP rule, a functional association with the division (removed again through cliogate's RemoveFunctionalRoleAssociation) and a grant of the stock CanExportGrid operation, which is denied and revoked again. clio's update, delete and association writes call AdministrationService.ActualizeAdminUnitInRole, which recomputes role membership for the stand. operation-position is window-only: it clears the stand's rights cache.",
